    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834530/extras/1c57527c14f79e7ffeccfbb10870da00.poster.avif?t=1670626050\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834530/extras/1c57527c14f79e7ffeccfbb10870da00.webm?t=1670626050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834530/extras/1c57527c14f79e7ffeccfbb10870da00.mp4?t=1670626050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Witch Slide is a free to play, co-operative (1-4 players), sliding and dodging game where you leave your village with great haste to find what has corrupted the nearby forest. While on your way it's easy to get into trouble - together with your friends you must find your way through puzzles and escape danger. <br><br><strong>Co-op Campaign </strong><br>The campaign can be played solo or with up to 4 players. The game is designed to allow you to all play smoothly from anywhere in the world without any input latency. <br><br><strong>Mobile Cross-Play </strong><br>Witch slide will be coming to the Google Play and Apple App Stores soon and will allow you to cross play with friends on PC while on the go.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Please Wishlist or join the  to be updated and play for free on release! </h2><br><br><br>Special thanks to the original creators of this genre for all the fun over many years. Witch Slide is inspired by the <i>Area of Ice Escape</i>, <i>Murloc Slide</i>, and <i>Ice Baneling Escape</i> maps from Warcraft III and Starcraft II.",
    "about_the_game": "Witch Slide is a free to play, co-operative (1-4 players), sliding and dodging game where you leave your village with great haste to find what has corrupted the nearby forest. While on your way it's easy to get into trouble - together with your friends you must find your way through puzzles and escape danger. <br><br><strong>Co-op Campaign </strong><br>The campaign can be played solo or with up to 4 players. The game is designed to allow you to all play smoothly from anywhere in the world without any input latency. <br><br><strong>Mobile Cross-Play </strong><br>Witch slide will be coming to the Google Play and Apple App Stores soon and will allow you to cross play with friends on PC while on the go.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Please Wishlist or join the  to be updated and play for free on release! </h2><br><br><br>Special thanks to the original creators of this genre for all the fun over many years. Witch Slide is inspired by the <i>Area of Ice Escape</i>, <i>Murloc Slide</i>, and <i>Ice Baneling Escape</i> maps from Warcraft III and Starcraft II.",
